https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0050.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_9892.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_9892.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_9787.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_9787.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0055.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0055.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0054.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2025/03/IMG_0054.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><p>The <a href=\"https://www.miamiboatshow.com/en/home.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2025 Discover Boating Miami International Boat Show</a> once again proved why it remains the premier marine event in the world. From <strong>February 12th to 16th</strong>, Miami welcomed over 100,000 attendees across six venues, each filled with cutting-edge marine technology, luxury yachts, and industry-leading innovations. With more than 1,000 exhibitors showcasing everything from personal watercraft to multi-million-dollar superyachts, this year’s event was a true celebration of the boating lifestyle.</p><p>FYI Yachts was proud to be part of this remarkable show, representing <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/okean-yachts-for-sale/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OKEAN Yachts</a> and <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/nhd-boats-for-sale/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NHD Boats</a> at two exciting locations.</p><p><strong>OKEAN Yachts Impresses on the Water</strong></p><p>Located on the water at Herald Plaza, <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/okean-yachts-for-sale/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OKEAN Yachts</a> turned heads with two of its most impressive models—the <strong>2025 OKEAN</strong> <strong>52’ and 57’</strong>. These yachts, known for their sleek designs and innovative fold-out balconies, captivated visitors from the moment they stepped aboard. The 57’ model, featuring an exclusive bow pool, was a standout attraction, drawing attention from yacht enthusiasts and industry insiders alike.</p><p>Throughout the event, the FYI Yachts team engaged with hundreds of potential buyers, discussing customization options and ownership opportunities. The interest was overwhelming, with numerous promising proposals and deals in the works, solidifying <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/okean-yachts-for-sale/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OKEAN Yachts’</a> position as a leader in innovative yacht design.</p><p><strong>NHD Boats’ Spectacular MIBS Debut</strong></p><p>Inside the Herald Plaza tents, <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/nhd-boats-for-sale/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NHD Boats</a> made a bold entrance into the U.S. market with its highly anticipated <strong>NHD 325, 355, and 365 models.</strong> This marked a historic moment as NHD Boats made its first-ever appearance at MIBS, and the response exceeded expectations.</p><p>Attendees were drawn to the modern styling, advanced technology, and top-tier performance features of the NHD lineup. Boating enthusiasts, industry professionals, and media representatives took a closer look at what makes these models stand out, leading to exciting new ownership opportunities and strong business discussions throughout the show.</p><p><strong>Looking Ahead to 2026!</strong></p><p>The <a href=\"https://www.miamiboatshow.com/en/home.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2025 Miami International Boat Show</a> was an incredible success for FYI Yachts, <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/okean-yachts-for-sale/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OKEAN Yachts</a>, and <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/nhd-boats-for-sale/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NHD Boats.</a> We’re beyond grateful for the enthusiastic support from everyone who visited our displays, and we can’t wait to see what’s next. With even more exciting innovations on the horizon, we look forward to welcoming you back in 2026!</p><p>Published on: February 21, 2025</p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/K-eVUBvx1p0?si=D1etnnVgsG8I6350&amp;controls=0\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe><b>Share this post</b><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Ffyiyachts.com%2Fmiami-international-boat-show-2025-recap%2F&amp;src=sdkpreparse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> </a><a href=\"https://x.com/intent/tweet?url=https://fyiyachts.com/miami-international-boat-show-2025-recap/%2F&amp;src=sdkpreparse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> </a><a href=\"mailto:?subject=Check out this post&amp;body=https://fyiyachts.com/miami-international-boat-show-2025-recap/%2F&amp;src=sdkpreparse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> </a>"}